{"name":"Barista","hex":"#bcafa2","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"barista","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who prepares coffee in a coffee shop for customers."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To work as a barista."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/barista"}],"entries":[{"title":"Barista","blocks":[{"text":"A barista is a person, usually a coffeehouse employee, who prepares and serves espresso-based coffee drinks and other beverages."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Gwilym_Davies.jpg/330px-Gwilym_Davies.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barista","wikidata":"Q178816"},{"title":"Barista (company)","blocks":[{"text":"Barista is a chain of espresso bars and cafes that operates in the Indian subcontinent. It is headquartered in Gurugram, India, and maintains outlets across India, and in other regional countries such as Sri Lanka, and Maldives. It is the second oldest coffee house chain in India and is currently India's second-largest coffee chain with over 425 cafes as of March 2024. It also sells a number of FMCG products through Modern & General retail stores across multiple locations."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Barista_Store_Front.jpg/330px-Barista_Store_Front.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barista_(company)","wikidata":"Q644735"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Linea_doubleespresso.jpg/330px-Linea_doubleespresso.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Linea_doubleespresso.jpg/330px-Linea_doubleespresso.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Exemplary espresso-making is essential to a barista's role. The term espresso comes from the Italian esprimere, which means 'to express', and refers to the process by which hot water is forced under pressure through ground coffee.[4]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALinea_doubleespresso.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Latte_at_Doppio_Ristretto_Chiang_Mai_02.jpg/500px-Latte_at_Doppio_Ristretto_Chiang_Mai_02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Latte_at_Doppio_Ristretto_Chiang_Mai_02.jpg/500px-Latte_at_Doppio_Ristretto_Chiang_Mai_02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Latte art is a visible sign of a trained barista and well-frothed milk.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALatte_at_Doppio_Ristretto_Chiang_Mai_02.jpg"}],"sounds":{"barista":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-barista.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c1/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-barista.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-barista.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c1/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-barista.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-barista.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey bucchero-ware bowl, Clay, 1000-700 BCE, Nr. Babakõy, Turkey, Fitzwilliam Museum, Cambridge","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Grey_bucchero-ware_bowl%2C_Clay%2C_1000-700_BCE%2C_Nr._Babak%C3%B5y%2C_Turkey%2C_Fitzwilliam_Museum%2C_Cambridge.jpg/500px-Grey_bucchero-ware_bowl%2C_Clay%2C_1000-700_BCE%2C_Nr._Babak%C3%B5y%2C_Turkey%2C_Fitzwilliam_Museum%2C_Cambridge.jpg","ratio":0.8,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_bucchero-ware_bowl,_Clay,_10